# 🎨 **Iridium 1.0.6 - Settings UX & Editor Polish**

*Released: 2026-01-09*

## 🎨 Major UI Improvements

* **JSON Config Editor**: Complete dark theme overhaul
  - Proper dark backgrounds for ACE editor
  - Styled toolbar buttons matching Iridium theme
  - Syntax highlighting with theme-appropriate colors
  - Dark context menus and search

* **Settings Page Redesign**:
  - New horizontal scrollable tabs
  - Active tab uses purple gradient
  - Better visual hierarchy with section cards
  - Improved form layouts and spacing

* **Users Table Actions**: 
  - Action buttons now properly styled with gradients
  - Edit (purple), Reset (orange), Delete (red)
  - Consistent 32px square buttons
  - QR code link styled as outlined button

## 🐛 Fixes

* **Toggle Sidebar Button**: Now hidden on desktop (sidebar opens on hover), visible only on mobile
* **Table Action Buttons**: Fixed white/square buttons - now have proper colors and rounded corners

---

# 🎨 **Iridium 1.0.5 - UI Polish & Fixes**

*Released: 2026-01-09*

## 🐛 Bug Fixes

* **Server Status Badge**: Fixed badge always showing "Server Offline" - now updates correctly based on Hysteria2 service status
* **QR Modal Close Button**: Fixed close button displaying as rectangle instead of X icon
* **Modal Close Buttons**: Updated all modals to use Bootstrap 5 `btn-close` class

## 🎨 Design Changes

* **Service Status Cards**: 
  - Active services now use solid purple gradient with white text (matches buttons)
  - Inactive services use solid red gradient with white text
  - Added enhanced hover effects with shadow and transform
* **Users Page Toolbar**: Complete redesign
  - Unified filter buttons with consistent styling
  - Sleek search box with focus effects
  - Clean action buttons (add, links, delete)
  - Proper spacing and alignment
  - Active filter state indication
* **Beautiful File Uploader**: Added modern drag & drop file uploader in Backup section
  - Drag and drop support
  - Visual feedback on file selection
  - File preview with remove option
  - Animated upload icon

---

# ✨ **Iridium 1.0.4 - UI Refinements & Subscription Name**

*Released: 2026-01-09*

## 🆕 New Features

* **Subscription Name**: Added customizable subscription name setting (replaces hardcoded "Hysteria2" in sub links)

## 🎨 Design Changes

* **Unified Button Styling**: 
  - All action buttons now use purple gradient (previously green)
  - Delete/stop buttons now have red gradient
  - Only two button types: purple (primary) and red (danger)
* **Table Borders**: Fixed white borders in users table - now uses dark theme borders
* **Dashboard Grouping**: Reorganized dashboard into logical groups:
  - System Resources (CPU, RAM, Uptime, Connections)
  - Network Information (Speed, IPs, Version)
  - Service Status (with purple glow for active services)
* **Service Status Cards**: 
  - Active services: purple gradient glow
  - Inactive services: muted gray style

---

# 🛠️ **Iridium 1.0.3 - Bug Fixes & UX Improvements**

*Released: 2026-01-09*

## 🐛 Bug Fixes

* **Config Editor**: Fixed config not loading on Config tab (selector fix)
* **QR Code Button**: Fixed QR code button not working on Users page (Bootstrap 5 migration)
* **Bootstrap 5 Migration**: Updated all `data-toggle` attributes to `data-bs-toggle`

## ✨ UX Improvements

* **Toast Notifications**: Replaced all modal alerts with toast notifications for less intrusive feedback
* **Overlay Sidebar**: Sidebar now hovers over content instead of pushing it
  - Collapsed by default (shows only icons)
  - Expands on hover
  - Mobile: hidden by default, slides in when toggled
* **Smoother Animations**: Improved sidebar and notification transitions

## 🎨 Visual Changes

* Sidebar width reduced when collapsed (70px) for more content space
* Brand text and nav labels fade in on sidebar hover
* Added backdrop overlay for mobile sidebar

